# Replace @OWNER with the GitHub team that operates the platform (for example
# @your-org/platform-engineering) before enabling "Require review from Code
# Owners" on main.
#
# The paths below are the ones where a merge grants something. Merging a file
# into gitops/ registers a service, which creates an ECR repository and trusts a
# repository of that name to publish images into it. That is an infrastructure
# change wearing a one-file disguise, so it is owned like one.

*                                   @OWNER

/gitops/                            @OWNER
/infrastructure/                    @OWNER
/platform/argocd/                   @OWNER
/platform/helm/                     @OWNER
/platform/scripts/                  @OWNER
/platform/backstage/catalog/org.yaml @OWNER
/.github/                           @OWNER
